%N A361160 Discriminants of Weierstrass curves in moduli space M_3 of compact Riemann surfaces of genus 3.
%C A361160 This sequence lists discriminants D of real quadratic orders such that the Weierstrass curve W_D (also called the Prym-Teichmüller curve W_D(4)) in the moduli space M_3 of genus 3 Riemann surfaces is nonempty. By a theorem of Lanneau and Nguyen, W_D is irreducible if D is even, has two components if D == 1 (mod 8), and is empty otherwise (see Lanneau-Nguyen 2014, or Theorem 5.3 of McMullen). Equivalently, this sequence lists the nonsquare positive integers congruent to either 0 (mod 4), or 1 (mod 8). - _Robin Visser_, Jul 23 2026
%H A361160 Robin Visser, <a href="/A361160/b361160.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%H A361160 Erwan Lanneau and Duc-Manh Nguyen, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1112/jtopol/jtt036">Teichmüller curves generated by Weierstrass Prym eigenforms in genus 3 and genus 4</a>, J. Topol. 7 (2014), no. 2, 475-522.
%H A361160 Curtis McMullen, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1090/bull/1782">Billiards and Teichmüller curves</a>, Bulletin of the American Mathematical Society, 60:2 (2023), 195-250. See Table C.2 on page 245.
%H A361160 David Torres-Teigell and Jonathan Zachhuber, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/imrn/rnw277">Orbifold points on Prym-Teichmüller curves in genus 3</a>, International Mathematics Research Notices 2018.4 (2018): 1228-1280. See also <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1502.05381">arXiv:1502.05381</a> [math.AG], 2015. See Table 2 on page 39.
%F A361160 Nonsquare positive integers congruent to either 0 (mod 4), or 1 (mod 8). - _Robin Visser_, Jul 23 2026
%o A361160 (PARI) v=[]; for(D=1, 500, if((D%4==0 || D%8==1) && !issquare(D), v=concat(v, D))); v \\ _Robin Visser_, Jul 23 2026
